mmand_begin_label` within the rendering servers no longer allocate a `String` each time it is called **when capture tools are disabled**. This would be the expected case for production. The `String` API is still available for `GDScript` and GDExtensions.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> Metal was worse that Windows or Linux, as it always returned `true` that debug capture was enabled\r\n\r\n- [x] Add allocation profiles demonstrating the before, after and when capture is disabled.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> Tested with the Bistro demo, running for 500 frames to be consistent across runs.\r\n\r\n| When | Capture Enabled? | Total Allocations | Instruments Preview |\r\n| :---- | :---- | :---- | :---- |\r\n| Before (Metal) | N | 33,978 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea8b1b04-2481-4968-adb9-2365e58fbe9c\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| Before (Win / Linux) | N | 16,941 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d12b1d1a-6a2f-4584-8a57-b3fb841e8c26\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| After (all) | N | 0 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54e05be9-0072-420c-8a26-335b3f5cb369\" width=\"200px\" /> |\r\n| After (all) | Y | 28 | <img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3f59aa5-1646-4e7a-84f4-470c1358ae00\" width=\"200px\" /> |","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"